  "body": "Hey!\r\n\r\nThe scenario: \r\nI invited a user from matrix.org to a room, created by mautrix-telegram bridge.\r\nBridge and my server are running on c.a2sc.eu\r\n\r\nThe user tries to accept:\r\n```\r\nFailed to join room\r\nYou are not invited to this room.\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe user rejects:\r\n```\r\nFailed to reject invite\r\n@matrixuser:matrix.org not in room !kjsafksaldlsad:my.homeserver.\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe error occurs very fast. Therefor, I don't think my server is even been connected from matrix.org - my serverlogs also don't show anything.\r\n\r\nClearing the cache before and after in Element does not help\r\n\r\nIf I invite s.o. from my homeserver to this group, no issues occur.\r\nIf I invite a user from matrix.org directly to another room, it works as well.",
